msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum error "
"correction skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Passe un examen de 20 questions sur le site IBM Training pour tester tes "
"compétences en correction d'erreurs quantiques et reçois un badge via "
"Credly."

