msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Sondage post-cours {#post-course-survey}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the \"Foundations of quantum error "
"correction\" course by IBM! Please take a moment to help us improve our "
"course by filling out the following [quick "
"survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your "
"feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. "
"Thank you!\n"
msgstr ""
"> **Note:** This survey is provided by IBM Quantum and relates to the "
"original English content. To give feedback on doQumentation's website, "
"translations, or code execution, please [open a GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/issues).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Teste tes connaissances {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam"
" for Foundations of quantum error correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir terminé les lectures et activités de ce cours, clique sur le "
"bouton ci-dessous pour accéder à IBM&reg; Training, où tu pourras passer "
"l'examen de certification pour les Fondements de la correction d'erreurs "
"quantiques.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'examen comprend 20 questions, et tu dois en répondre correctement à au "
"moins 16 pour le réussir. Dès que tu obtiens une note de passage, ton badge "
"sera automatiquement envoyé à l'adresse e-mail que tu as utilisée pour "
"t'inscrire à IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Assure-toi d'être prêt à passer l'examen. Si tu n'obtiens pas une note de "
"passage en deux tentatives, l'examen sera temporairement verrouillé.\n"

